\q2 \rb and the wild|הַ֝שָּׂדֶ֗ה\rb* \rb animals|וְחַיַּ֥ת\rb* \rb will be at peace|הָשְׁלְמָה־\rb* \rb with you|לָֽךְ׃\rb*.
