\q1 \v 25 \rb You will know|וְֽ֭יָדַעְתָּ\rb* \rb that|כִּי־\rb* \rb your offspring|זַרְעֶ֑ךָ\rb* \rb will be many|רַ֣ב\rb*,
\q2 \rb your descendants|וְ֝צֶאֱצָאֶ֗יךָ\rb* \rb like the grass|כְּעֵ֣שֶׂב\rb* \rb of the earth|הָאָֽרֶץ׃\rb*.
