\c 6
\s1 Job Replies: My Complaint Is Just
\p \v 1 \rb Then Job|אִיּ֗וֹב\rb*\rb |וַיֹּאמַֽר׃\rb* \rb replied|וַיַּ֥עַן\rb*:
\b 
\q1 \v 2 “\rb If only|ל֗וּ\rb* \rb my grief|כַּעְשִׂ֑י\rb* \rb could be weighed|שָׁק֣וֹל\rb*\rb |יִשָּׁקֵ֣ל\rb*
\q2 \rb and placed|יִשְׂאוּ־\rb* \rb with|יָֽחַד׃\rb* \rb my calamity|וְהַיָּתִי\rb* \rb on the scales|בְּֽמֹאזְנַ֥יִם\rb*.
\q1 \v 3 \rb For|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb then|עַתָּ֗ה\rb* \rb it would outweigh|יִכְבָּ֑ד\rb* \rb the sand|מֵח֣וֹל\rb* \rb of the seas|יַמִּ֣ים\rb* —
\q2 \rb no wonder|עַל־\rb*\rb |כֵּ֝֗ן\rb* \rb my words|דְּבָרַ֥י\rb* \rb have been rash|לָֽעוּ׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 4 \rb For|כִּ֤י\rb* \rb the arrows|חִצֵּ֪י\rb* \rb of the Almighty|שַׁדַּ֡י\rb* \rb have pierced me|עִמָּדִ֗י\rb*;\rb |אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb*
\q2 \rb my spirit|רוּחִ֑י\rb* \rb drinks in|שֹׁתָ֣ה\rb* \rb their poison|חֲ֭מָתָם\rb*;
\q2 \rb the terrors|בִּעוּתֵ֖י\rb* \rb of God|אֱל֣וֹהַּ\rb* \rb are arrayed against me|יַֽעַרְכֽוּנִי׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 5 \rb Does a wild donkey|פֶּ֥רֶא\rb* \rb bray|הֲיִֽנְהַק־\rb* \rb over|עֲלֵי־\rb* \rb fresh grass|דֶ֑שֶׁא\rb*,
\q2 \rb or|אִ֥ם\rb* \rb an ox|שּׁ֝֗וֹר\rb* \rb low|יִגְעֶה־\rb* \rb over|עַל־\rb* \rb its fodder|בְּלִילֽוֹ׃\rb*?
\q1 \v 6 \rb Is tasteless food|תָּ֭פֵל\rb* \rb eaten|הֲיֵאָכֵ֣ל\rb* \rb without|מִבְּלִי־\rb* \rb salt|מֶ֑לַח\rb*,
\q2 \rb or|אִם־\rb* \rb is there|יֶשׁ־\rb* \rb flavor|טַ֝֗עַם\rb* \rb in the white|בְּרִ֣יר\rb* \rb of an egg|חַלָּמֽוּת׃\rb*\f + \fr 6:6 \ft Or \fqa in the sap of the mallow plant\f*?
\q1 \v 7 \rb My soul|נַפְשִׁ֑י\rb* \rb refuses|מֵאֲנָ֣ה\rb* \rb to touch them|לִנְגּ֣וֹעַ\rb*;
\q2 \rb they are|הֵ֝֗מָּה\rb* \rb loathsome|כִּדְוֵ֥י\rb* \rb food to me|לַחְמִֽי׃\rb*.
\b 
\q1 \v 8 \rb If only|מִֽי־\rb*\rb |יִ֭תֵּן\rb* \rb my request|שֶֽׁאֱלָתִ֑י\rb* \rb were granted|תָּב֣וֹא\rb*
\q2 \rb and God|אֱלֽוֹהַּ׃\rb* \rb would fulfill|יִתֵּ֥ן\rb* \rb my hope|וְ֝תִקְוָתִ֗י\rb*:
\q1 \v 9 \rb that God|אֱ֭לוֹהַּ\rb* \rb would be willing|וְיֹאֵ֣ל\rb* \rb to crush me|וִֽידַכְּאֵ֑נִי\rb*,
\q2 \rb to unleash|יַתֵּ֥ר\rb* \rb His hand|יָ֝ד֗וֹ\rb* \rb and cut me off|וִֽיבַצְּעֵֽנִי׃\rb*!
\q1 \v 10 \rb It still|ע֨וֹד׀\rb* \rb brings me|וּ֥תְהִי\rb* \rb comfort|נֶ֘חָ֤מָתִ֗י\rb*,
