\q1 \rb that|כִּי־\rb* \rb I have not|לֹ֥א\rb* \rb denied|כִ֝חַ֗דְתִּי\rb*
\q2 \rb the words|אִמְרֵ֥י\rb* \rb of the Holy One|קָדֽוֹשׁ׃\rb*.
\b 
\q1 \v 11 \rb What|מַה־\rb* \rb strength do I have|כֹּחִ֥י\rb*, \rb that|כִֽי־\rb* \rb I should still hope|אֲיַחֵ֑ל\rb*?
\q2 \rb What|וּמַה־\rb* \rb is my future|קִּ֝צִּ֗י\rb*, \rb that|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb I|נַפְשִֽׁי׃\rb* \rb should be patient|אַאֲרִ֥יךְ\rb*?
\q1 \v 12 \rb Is my strength|כֹּ֣חַ\rb* \rb like that|כֹּחִ֑י\rb* \rb of stone|אֲבָנִ֣ים\rb*,
\q2 \rb or|אִם־\rb* \rb my flesh|בְּשָׂרִ֥י\rb* \rb made of bronze|נָחֽוּשׁ׃\rb*\rb |אִֽם־\rb*?
\q1 \v 13 \rb Is there any|הַאִ֬ם\rb*\rb |אֵ֣ין\rb* \rb help|עֶזְרָתִ֣י\rb* \rb within me|בִ֑י\rb*
\q2 \rb now that success|וְ֝תֻשִׁיָּ֗ה\rb* \rb is driven|נִדְּחָ֥ה\rb* \rb from me|מִמֶּֽנִּי׃\rb*?
\b 
\q1 \v 14 \rb A despairing man|לַמָּ֣ס\rb* \rb should have the kindness|חָ֑סֶד\rb* \rb of his friend|מֵרֵעֵ֣הוּ\rb*,
\q2 \rb even if he forsakes|יַעֲזֽוֹב׃\rb* \rb the fear|וְיִרְאַ֖ת\rb* \rb of the Almighty|שַׁדַּ֣י\rb*.
\q1 \v 15 \rb But my brothers|אַ֭חַי\rb* \rb are as faithless|בָּגְד֣וּ\rb* \rb as|כְמוֹ־\rb* \rb wadis|נָ֑חַל\rb*,
\q2 \rb as seasonal streams|כַּאֲפִ֖יק\rb*\rb |נְחָלִ֣ים\rb* \rb that overflow|יַעֲבֹֽרוּ׃\rb*,
\q1 \v 16 \rb darkened|הַקֹּדְרִ֥ים\rb* \rb because|מִנִּי־\rb* \rb of the ice|קָ֑רַח\rb*
\q2 \rb and the inflow|עָ֝לֵ֗ימוֹ\rb* \rb of melting|יִתְעַלֶּם־\rb* \rb snow|שָֽׁלֶג׃\rb*,
\q1 \v 17 \rb but ceasing|נִצְמָ֑תוּ\rb* \rb in the dry season|בְּ֭עֵת\rb*\rb |יְזֹרְב֣וּ\rb*
\q2 \rb and vanishing|נִדְעֲכ֥וּ\rb* \rb from their channels|מִמְּקוֹמָֽם׃\rb* \rb in the heat|בְּ֝חֻמּ֗וֹ\rb*.
\b 
\q1 \v 18 \rb Caravans|אָרְח֣וֹת\rb* \rb turn aside|יִ֭לָּ֣פְתוּ\rb* \rb from their routes|דַּרְכָּ֑ם\rb*;
\q2 \rb they go|יַעֲל֖וּ\rb* \rb into the wasteland|בַתֹּ֣הוּ\rb* \rb and perish|וְיֹאבֵֽדוּ׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 19 \rb The caravans|אָרְח֣וֹת\rb* \rb of Tema|תֵּמָ֑א\rb* \rb look for water|הִ֭בִּיטוּ\rb*;
\q2 \rb the travelers|הֲלִיכֹ֥ת\rb* \rb of Sheba|שְׁ֝בָ֗א\rb* \rb hope|קִוּוּ־\rb* \rb to find it|לָֽמוֹ׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 20 \rb They are confounded|בֹּ֥שׁוּ\rb* \rb because|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb they had hoped|בָטָ֑ח\rb*;
\q2 \rb their arrival|בָּ֥אוּ\rb*\rb |עָ֝דֶ֗יהָ\rb* \rb brings disappointment|וַיֶּחְפָּֽרוּ׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 21 \rb For|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb now|עַ֭תָּה\rb* \rb you are|הֱיִ֣יתֶם\rb* \rb of no help|לֹא\rb*;
\q2 \rb you see|תִּֽרְא֥וּ\rb* \rb terror|חֲ֝תַ֗ת\rb*, \rb and you are afraid|וַתִּירָֽאוּ׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 22 \rb Have I ever|הֲ‍ֽכִי־\rb* \rb said|אָ֭מַרְתִּי\rb*, ‘\rb Give me something|הָ֣בוּ\rb*;
\q2 \rb offer me a bribe|שִׁחֲד֥וּ\rb*\rb |בַעֲדִֽי׃\rb* \rb from your wealth|וּ֝מִכֹּחֲכֶ֗ם\rb*;
\q1 \v 23 \rb deliver me|וּמַלְּט֥וּנִי\rb* \rb from the hand|מִיַּד־\rb* \rb of the enemy|צָ֑ר\rb*;
\q2 \rb redeem me|תִּפְדּֽוּנִי׃\rb* \rb from the grasp|וּמִיַּ֖ד\rb* \rb of the ruthless|עָרִיצִ֣ים\rb*’ ?
\b 
\q1 \v 24 \rb Teach me|ה֭וֹרוּנִי\rb*, \rb and I|וַאֲנִ֣י\rb* \rb will be silent|אַחֲרִ֑ישׁ\rb*.
\q2 \rb Help me understand|הָבִ֥ינוּ\rb* \rb how|וּמַה־\rb* \rb I have erred|שָּׁ֝גִ֗יתִי\rb*.
\q1 \v 25 \rb How|מַה־\rb* \rb painful|נִּמְרְצ֥וּ\rb* \rb are honest|יֹ֑שֶׁר\rb* \rb words|אִמְרֵי־\rb*!
\q2 \rb But what|וּמַה־\rb* \rb does your argument|יּוֹכִ֖יחַ\rb*\rb |מִכֶּֽם׃\rb* \rb prove|הוֹכֵ֣חַ\rb*?
\q1 \v 26 \rb Do you intend|תַּחְשֹׁ֑בוּ\rb* \rb to correct|הַלְהוֹכַ֣ח\rb* \rb my words|מִלִּ֣ים\rb*,
\q2 \rb and treat as wind|וּ֝לְר֗וּחַ\rb* \rb my cry|אִמְרֵ֥י\rb* \rb of despair|נֹאָֽשׁ׃\rb*?
\q1 \v 27 \rb You would even cast lots|תַּפִּ֑ילוּ\rb* \rb for an orphan|יָת֥וֹם\rb*
\q2 \rb and barter|וְ֝תִכְר֗וּ\rb* \rb away|עַל־\rb*\rb |אַף־\rb*\rb |עַל־\rb* \rb your friend|רֵֽיעֲכֶֽם׃\rb*.
\b 
\q1 \v 28 \rb But now|וְ֭עַתָּה\rb*, \rb please|הוֹאִ֣ילוּ\rb* \rb look|פְנוּ־\rb* \rb at me|בִ֑י\rb*.
