\q1 \v 29 \rb Reconsider|שֻֽׁבוּ־\rb*;\rb |נָ֭א\rb* \rb do not|אַל־\rb* \rb be|תְּהִ֣י\rb* \rb unjust|עַוְלָ֑ה\rb*.
\q2 \rb Reconsider|וְשֻׁבִי\rb*, \rb for my righteousness|צִדְקִי־\rb*\rb |ע֝וֹד\rb* \rb is at stake|בָֽהּ׃\rb*.
