\q1 \v 15 \rb For|אֲשֶׁ֣ר\rb* \rb even if|אִם־\rb* \rb I were right|צָ֭דַקְתִּי\rb*, \rb I could not|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb answer|אֶעֱנֶ֑ה\rb*.
\q2 \rb I could only beg my Judge|לִ֝מְשֹׁפְטִ֗י\rb* \rb for mercy|אֶתְחַנָּֽן׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 16 \rb If|אִם־\rb* \rb I summoned Him|קָרָ֥אתִי\rb* \rb and He answered me|וַֽיַּעֲנֵ֑נִי\rb*,
