\q1 \v 18 \rb He does not|לֹֽא־\rb* \rb let me|יִ֭תְּנֵנִי\rb* \rb catch|הָשֵׁ֣ב\rb* \rb my breath|רוּחִ֑י\rb*,
\q2 \rb but|כִּ֥י\rb* \rb overwhelms me|יַ֝שְׂבִּעַ֗נִי\rb* \rb with bitterness|מַמְּרֹרִֽים׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 19 \rb If|אִם־\rb* \rb it is a matter of strength|לְכֹ֣חַ\rb*,
\q2 \rb He is indeed|הִנֵּ֑ה\rb* \rb mighty|אַמִּ֣יץ\rb*!
