\c 21
\s1 Job: God Will Punish the Wicked
\p \v 1 \rb Then Job|אִיּ֗וֹב\rb*\rb |וַיֹּאמַֽר׃\rb* \rb answered|וַיַּ֥עַן\rb*:
\b 
\q1 \v 2 “\rb Listen carefully|שִׁמְע֣וּ\rb*\rb |שָׁ֭מוֹעַ\rb* \rb to my words|מִלָּתִ֑י\rb*;
\q2 \rb let this|זֹ֝֗את\rb* \rb be|וּתְהִי־\rb* \rb your consolation to me|תַּנְח֥וּמֹֽתֵיכֶֽם׃\rb*.
