\q2 \rb growing old|עָ֝תְק֗וּ\rb* \rb and|גַּם־\rb* \rb increasing|גָּ֥בְרוּ\rb* \rb in power|חָֽיִל׃\rb*?
\q1 \v 8 \rb Their descendants|זַרְעָ֤ם\rb* \rb are established|נָכ֣וֹן\rb* \rb around them|עִמָּ֑ם\rb*\rb |לִפְנֵיהֶ֣ם\rb*,
\q2 \rb and their offspring|וְ֝צֶאֱצָאֵיהֶ֗ם\rb* \rb before their eyes|לְעֵינֵיהֶֽם׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 9 \rb Their homes|בָּתֵּיהֶ֣ם\rb* \rb are safe|שָׁל֣וֹם\rb* \rb from fear|מִפָּ֑חַד\rb*;
