\q2 \rb and making merry|וְ֝יִשְׂמְח֗וּ\rb* \rb at the sound|לְק֣וֹל\rb* \rb of the flute|עוּגָֽב׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 13 \rb They spend|יְבַלּוּ\rb* \rb their days|יְמֵיהֶ֑ם\rb* \rb in prosperity|בַטּ֣וֹב\rb*
\q2 \rb and go down|יֵחָֽתּוּ׃\rb* \rb to Sheol|שְׁא֣וֹל\rb* \rb in peace|וּ֝בְרֶ֗גַע\rb*.\f + \fr 21:13 \ft Or \fqa in an instant\f*
