\q2 \rb and what|וּמַה־\rb* \rb would we gain|נּ֝וֹעִ֗יל\rb* \rb if|כִּ֣י\rb* \rb we pray|נִפְגַּע־\rb* \rb to Him|בּֽוֹ׃\rb*?’
