\b 
\q1 \v 17 \rb How often|כַּמָּ֤ה׀\rb* \rb is the lamp|נֵר־\rb* \rb of the wicked|רְשָׁ֘עִ֤ים\rb* \rb put out|יִדְעָ֗ךְ\rb*?
