\q1 \v 19 \rb It is said that God|אֱל֗וֹהַּ\rb* \rb lays up|יִצְפֹּן־\rb* \rb one’s punishment|אוֹנ֑וֹ\rb* \rb for his children|לְבָנָ֥יו\rb*.
