\q1 \v 20 \rb Let his eyes|עֵינוֹ\rb* \rb see|יִרְא֣וּ\rb* \rb his own destruction|כִּיד֑וֹ\rb*;
\q2 \rb let him drink for himself|יִשְׁתֶּֽה׃\rb* \rb the wrath|וּמֵחֲמַ֖ת\rb* \rb of the Almighty|שַׁדַּ֣י\rb*.
\q1 \v 21 \rb For|כִּ֤י\rb* \rb what|מַה־\rb* \rb does he care|חֶפְצ֣וֹ\rb* \rb about his household|בְּבֵית֣וֹ\rb* \rb after him|אַחֲרָ֑יו\rb*,
