\b 
\q1 \v 22 \rb Can anyone teach|יְלַמֶּד־\rb* \rb knowledge|דָּ֑עַת\rb* \rb to God|הַלְאֵ֥ל\rb*,
\q2 \rb since He|וְ֝ה֗וּא\rb* \rb judges|יִשְׁפּֽוֹט׃\rb* \rb those on high|רָמִ֥ים\rb*?
