\q1 \v 13 \rb The dying man|אֹ֭בֵד\rb*\rb |עָלַ֣י\rb*\rb |תָּבֹ֑א\rb* \rb blessed me|בִּרְכַּ֣ת\rb*,
\q2 \rb and I made the widow’s|אַלְמָנָ֣ה\rb* \rb heart|וְלֵ֖ב\rb* \rb sing for joy|אַרְנִֽן׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 14 \rb I put on|לָ֭בַשְׁתִּי\rb* \rb righteousness|צֶ֣דֶק\rb*, \rb and it clothed me|וַיִּלְבָּשֵׁ֑נִי\rb*;
