\q1 \v 24 \rb Trembling|בְּרַ֣עַשׁ\rb* \rb with excitement|וְ֭רֹגֶז\rb*, \rb he devours|יְגַמֶּא־\rb* \rb the distance|אָ֑רֶץ\rb*;
