\c 40
\s1 Job Humbles Himself before the LORD
\p \v 1 \rb And the LORD|יְהוָ֥ה\rb* \rb said|וַיַּ֖עַן\rb* \rb to Job|אִיּ֗וֹב\rb*\rb |וַיֹּאמַֽר׃\rb*:
\b 
\q1 \v 2 “\rb Will the faultfinder|יִסּ֑וֹר\rb* \rb contend|הֲ֭רֹב\rb* \rb with|עִם־\rb* \rb the Almighty|שַׁדַּ֣י\rb*?
