\b 
\q1 
\p \v 3 \rb Then Job|אִיּ֥וֹב\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb answered|וַיַּ֖עַן\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֗ה\rb*\rb |וַיֹּאמַֽר׃\rb*:
\b 
\q1 \v 4 “\rb Behold|הֵ֣ן\rb*, \rb I am insignificant|קַ֭לֹּתִי\rb*. \rb How|מָ֣ה\rb* \rb can I reply to You|אֲשִׁיבֶ֑ךָּ\rb*?
\q2 \rb I place|שַׂ֣מְתִּי\rb* \rb my hand|יָ֝דִ֗י\rb* \rb over|לְמוֹ־\rb* \rb my mouth|פִֽי׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 5 \rb I have spoken|דִּ֭בַּרְתִּי\rb* \rb once|אַחַ֣ת\rb*, \rb but I have no|וְלֹ֣א\rb* \rb answer|אֶֽעֱנֶ֑ה\rb* —
\q2 \rb twice|וּ֝שְׁתַּ֗יִם\rb*, \rb but I have nothing|וְלֹ֣א\rb* \rb to add|אוֹסִֽיף׃פ\rb*.”
\s1 The LORD Challenges Job Again
\p \v 6 \rb Then the LORD|יְהוָ֣ה\rb* \rb answered|וַיַּֽעַן־\rb* \rb Job|אִ֭יּוֹב\rb* \rb out of|מִנ\rb* \rb the whirlwind|סְעָרָה\rb* \rb and said|וַיֹּאמַֽר׃\rb*:
\b 
\q1 \v 7 “\rb Now|נָ֣א\rb* \rb brace|אֱזָר־\rb* \rb yourself|חֲלָצֶ֑יךָ\rb*\f + \fr 40:7 \ft Hebrew \fqa gird up your loins\f* \rb like a man|כְגֶ֣בֶר\rb*;
\q2 \rb I will question you|אֶ֝שְׁאָלְךָ֗\rb*, \rb and you shall inform Me|וְהוֹדִיעֵֽנִי׃\rb*.\f + \fr 40:7 \ft Cited in \ref Job 42:4|JOB 42:4\ref*\f*
\b 
\q1 \v 8 \rb Would you really|הַ֭אַף\rb* \rb annul|תָּפֵ֣ר\rb* \rb My justice|מִשְׁפָּטִ֑י\rb*?
\q2 \rb Would you condemn Me|תַּ֝רְשִׁיעֵ֗נִי\rb* \rb to|לְמַ֣עַן\rb* \rb justify yourself?|תִּצְדָּֽק׃\rb*
\q1 \v 9 \rb |וְאִם־\rb* \rb Do you have an arm|זְר֖וֹעַ\rb* \rb like God’s|כָּאֵ֥ל׀\rb*?
\q2 \rb Can you thunder|תַרְעֵֽם׃\rb* \rb with a voice|וּ֝בְק֗וֹל\rb* \rb like His|כָּמֹ֥הוּ\rb*?
