\q2 \rb look on|וּרְאֵ֥ה\rb* \rb every|כָל־\rb* \rb proud man|גֵּ֝אֶ֗ה\rb* \rb and bring him low|וְהַשְׁפִּילֵֽהוּ׃\rb*.
