\q2 \rb trample|וַהֲדֹ֖ךְ\rb* \rb the wicked|רְשָׁעִ֣ים\rb* \rb where they stand|תַּחְתָּֽם׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 13 \rb Bury them|טָמְנֵ֣ם\rb* \rb together|יָ֑חַד\rb*\rb |פְּ֝נֵיהֶ֗ם\rb* \rb in the dust|בֶּעָפָ֣ר\rb*;
\q2 \rb imprison them|חֲבֹ֣שׁ\rb* \rb in the grave|בַּטָּמֽוּן׃\rb*.\f + \fr 40:13 \ft Or \fqa in the hidden place\f*
\q1 \v 14 \rb Then|וְגַם־\rb* \rb I|אֲנִ֥י\rb* \rb will confess to you|אוֹדֶ֑ךָּ\rb*
\q2 \rb that|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb your own right hand|יְמִינֶֽךָ׃\rb* \rb can save|תוֹשִׁ֖עַ\rb* \rb you|לְךָ֣\rb*.
\b 
\q1 \v 15 \rb Look at|הִנֵּה־\rb*\rb |נָ֣א\rb* \rb Behemoth|בְ֭הֵמוֹת\rb*, \rb which|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb I made|עָשִׂ֣יתִי\rb* \rb along with you|עִמָּ֑ךְ\rb*.
