\q1 \v 21 \rb He lies|יִשְׁכָּ֑ב\rb* \rb under|תַּֽחַת־\rb* \rb the lotus plants|צֶאֱלִ֥ים\rb*,\f + \fr 40:21 \ft Or \fqa bramble bushes\ft ; also in verse 22\f*
\q2 \rb hidden|בְּסֵ֖תֶר\rb* \rb among the reeds|קָנֶ֣ה\rb* \rb of the marsh|וּבִצָּֽה׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 22 \rb The lotus plants|צֶאֱלִ֣ים\rb* \rb conceal him|יְסֻכֻּ֣הוּ\rb* \rb in their shade|צִֽלֲל֑וֹ\rb*;
\q2 \rb the willows|עַרְבֵי־\rb*\f + \fr 40:22 \ft Or \fqa poplars\f* \rb of the brook|נָֽחַל׃\rb* \rb surround him|יְ֝סֻבּ֗וּהוּ\rb*.
\q1 \v 23 \rb Though|הֵ֤ן\rb* \rb the river|נָ֭הָר\rb* \rb rages|יַעֲשֹׁ֣ק\rb*, \rb Behemoth is unafraid|לֹ֣א\rb*\rb |יַחְפּ֑וֹז\rb*;
\q2 \rb he remains secure|יִבְטַ֓ח׀\rb*, \rb though|כִּֽי־\rb* \rb the Jordan|יַרְדֵּ֣ן\rb* \rb surges|יָגִ֖יחַ\rb* \rb to|אֶל־\rb* \rb his mouth|פִּֽיהוּ׃\rb*.
\q1 \v 24 \rb Can anyone capture him|יִקָּחֶ֑נּוּ\rb* \rb as he looks on|בְּעֵינָ֥יו\rb*,
\q2 \rb or pierce|יִנְקָב־\rb* \rb his nose|אָֽף׃\rb* \rb with a snare|בְּ֝מֽוֹקְשִׁ֗ים\rb*?[’’]
\c 41
