\q2 \rb or his head|רֹאשֽׁוֹ׃\rb* \rb with fishing|דָּגִ֣ים\rb* \rb spears|וּבְצִלְצַ֖ל\rb*?
\q1 \v 8 \rb If you lay|שִׂים־\rb* \rb a hand|כַּפֶּ֑ךָ\rb* \rb on him|עָלָ֥יו\rb*,
\q2 \rb you will remember|זְכֹ֥ר\rb* \rb the battle|מִ֝לְחָמָ֗ה\rb* \rb and never|אַל־\rb* \rb repeat it|תּוֹסַֽף׃\rb*!
\b 
\q1 \v 9 \rb Surely|הֵן־\rb* \rb hope of overcoming him|תֹּחַלְתּ֥וֹ\rb* \rb is false|נִכְזָ֑בָה\rb*.
